[{"client_msg_id":"6d75b0da-91cc-40ba-b358-fefc3f20f909","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/kaoriya/status/1374712019857776640\u003e","ts":"1616591887.046000","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/kaoriya|@kaoriya\u003e: 静電容量Helix 組み立てやります～\n\n\u003chttps://youtu.be/cBSTL3KHgSY\u003e","id":1,"author_name":"MURAOKA Taro","author_subname":"@kaoriya","author_link":"https://twitter.com/kaoriya/status/1374712019857776640","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1196794099/avatar_normal.JPEG","text":"静電容量Helix 組み立てやります～\n\n\u003chttps://youtu.be/cBSTL3KHgSY\u003e","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1616591861,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/kaoriya/status/1374712019857776640","original_url":"https://twitter.com/kaoriya/status/1374712019857776640"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pPEg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"40ad5c57-2d74-4380-9ada-d6f480f920ad","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/kaoriya/status/1374578828182384647\u003e","ts":"1616560208.043400","thread_ts":"1616560208.043400","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/kaoriya|@kaoriya\u003e: 静電容量Helixキットの内容物の記録。 \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/ExN8KKFVIAM8UYM.jpg\u003e","id":1,"author_name":"MURAOKA Taro","author_subname":"@kaoriya","author_link":"https://twitter.com/kaoriya/status/1374578828182384647","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1196794099/avatar_normal.JPEG","text":"静電容量Helixキットの内容物の記録。 \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/ExN8KKFVIAM8UYM.jpg\u003e","image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/ExN8KKFVIAM8UYM.jpg","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1616560105,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/kaoriya/status/1374578828182384647","original_url":"https://twitter.com/kaoriya/status/1374578828182384647"}],"reply_count":8,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+43"}]},{"client_msg_id":"55f055be-6603-4cc8-8eff-70013079bc99","type":"message","user":"U01NHAYE0BV","text":"銀鮭さんが販売しておられるキットでしょうか？Nizのスイッチだったと記憶してますが、topreとの打鍵感の違いが気になるところです。(Niz触ったことない)","ts":"1616560394.044000","thread_ts":"1616560208.043400","edited":{"user":"U01NHAYE0BV","ts":"1616560404.000000"},"parent_user_id":"U06BRP8VD","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hov"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b88909e0-c0fa-45ce-9f40-299e909c8f5c","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ですです。Nizのキーボードはいま輸送中w","ts":"1616560426.044300","thread_ts":"1616560208.043400","parent_user_id":"U06BRP8VD","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"K0x/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"48bc2b3f-4b5b-4171-bb5a-67e8525fd37a","type":"message","user":"U01NHAYE0BV","text":"Nizからスイッチをぶんどる感じでしょうか？去年多分コロナのせいで品切れ気味だったけど、今見たら普通に買えそう。。\n\nHelixは親指内側の４キー分、何に使うかアイデア浮かばないです。他のキーボードとキーマップなるべく合わせようとすると、持ってるものの中で最小の方に最適化されますからね。","ts":"1616560653.044500","thread_ts":"1616560208.043400","parent_user_id":"U06BRP8VD","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"P0yw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"47bd5b7d-9bef-454c-9411-7d0e7dfc372e","type":"message","user":"U01NHAYE0BV","text":"(スイッチ単体でも売ってますね)","ts":"1616560693.044700","thread_ts":"1616560208.043400","parent_user_id":"U06BRP8VD","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zIQy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e87a6ec5-9a48-4480-8522-5d9d3a05b206","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"それはどうもハウジング\u0026amp;軸だけっぽいんですよね。ラバーとリングがない。なのでキーボード買いました。","ts":"1616560723.044900","thread_ts":"1616560208.043400","parent_user_id":"U06BRP8VD","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pyg//"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d7e73b9a-af33-4d31-9d8c-01856d4dab90","type":"message","user":"U01NHAYE0BV","text":"なるほど、silicone domesで別売りっぽいですね。これはよく読まないと引っかかりそう。。","ts":"1616560856.045100","thread_ts":"1616560208.043400","parent_user_id":"U06BRP8VD","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QYr5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e359e185-6a93-4a27-809b-16409b7c4dea","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"EC Helixのビルドログにそのあたりのことは書いてありますよ。 \u003chttps://github.com/ginjake/ec_helix_build\u003e","ts":"1616560883.045300","thread_ts":"1616560208.043400","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: ginjake/ec_helix_build","id":1,"title":"ginjake/ec_helix_build","title_link":"https://github.com/ginjake/ec_helix_build","text":"Contribute to ginjake/ec_helix_build development by creating an account on GitHub.","thumb_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16838187?s=400\u0026v=4","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","thumb_width":400,"thumb_height":400,"from_url":"https://github.com/ginjake/ec_helix_build","original_url":"https://github.com/ginjake/ec_helix_build"}],"parent_user_id":"U06BRP8VD","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"pray","count":1,"users":["U01NHAYE0BV"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"j916P"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c55bdb81-c25d-45f5-9e61-3f57aa8f67d4","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"あとBOOTHの販売ページか。","ts":"1616560908.045600","thread_ts":"1616560208.043400","parent_user_id":"U06BRP8VD","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pBymd"}]}]
